/**
 * @brief Locks the FLASH Program Erase Controller.
 * @note This function can be used for all STM32F10x devices.
 *       - For STM32F10X_XL devices, this function locks both Bank1 and Bank2.
 *       - For all other devices, it locks Bank1 and is equivalent to FLASH_LockBank1.
 * @param None
 * @retval None
